            </a:pPr>
            <a:r>
              <a:t/>
            </a:r>
            <a:endParaRPr/>
          </a:p>
          <a:p>
            <a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l">
              <a:spcBef>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcBef>
              <a:spcAft>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcAft>
              <a:buNone/>
            </a:pPr>
            <a:r>
              <a:rPr lang="en"/>
              <a:t>On the right, you see how bolt-on AI works: session-based. Every ticket is isolated. Email, Chat, Voice &#8212; they're all separate records. The AI resolves each ticket without knowing it's the same person, without any context about their history, their value, their relationship with your brand.</a:t>
            </a:r>
            <a:endParaRPr/>
          </a:p>
          <a:p>
            <a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l">
              <a:spcBef>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcBef>
              <a:spcAft>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcAft>
              <a:buNone/>
            </a:pPr>
            <a:r>
              <a:t/>
            </a:r>
            <a:endParaRPr/>
          </a:p>
          <a:p>
            <a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l">
              <a:spcBef>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcBef>
              <a:spcAft>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcAft>
              <a:buNone/>
            </a:pPr>
            <a:r>
              <a:rPr lang="en"/>
              <a:t>On the left is Gladly: customer-centered. One persistent profile. Every interaction &#8212; across every channel, whether AI or human &#8212; is part of a single lifelong conversation.</a:t>
            </a:r>
            <a:endParaRPr/>
          </a:p>
          <a:p>
            <a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l">
              <a:spcBef>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcBef>
              <a:spcAft>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcAft>
              <a:buNone/>
            </a:pPr>
            <a:r>
              <a:t/>
            </a:r>
            <a:endParaRPr/>
          </a:p>
          <a:p>
            <a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l">
              <a:spcBef>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcBef>
              <a:spcAft>
                <a:spcPts val="0"/>
              </a:spcAft>
              <a:buNone/>
            </a:pPr>
            <a:r>
              <a:rPr lang="en"/>
              <a:t>When a customer reaches out, our AI knows they're a VIP member with 12 orders and $2,847 in lifetime value who called yesterday about a shipping issue. It doesn't ask them to repeat themselves. It makes judgment calls based on who they are.</a:t>
            </a:r>
            <a:endParaRPr/>
          </a:p>
          <a:p>
            <a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" rtl="0" algn="l">
